# FFSA Hub environment template.
# The full local list lives in `.env.local.example`. Copy that file to `.env.local`.
#
# Missio volunteer links. Server only. Required before a pastor can copy a link
# or a volunteer can open one. The server fails closed when this is empty.
# The raw link is HMAC-SHA256 of this secret, the request id, the contact id,
# and a per-row nonce. Only the nonce and a SHA-256 hash are stored.
MISSIO_AVAILABILITY_TOKEN_SECRET=replace-with-a-long-random-string
